<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed sharply higher in heavy trading Monday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 50.68 to 5889.20, a record.</p>
<p>The NYSE composite rose 1.72 to 365.42, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.18.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1397 to 978.</p>
<p>Volume was 430,078,914, compared with 487,502,110 Friday.</p>
